g\u2019s locomotion and the thrill of tagging or escaping in parkour-style arenas, you\u2019re going to feel right at home. Whether you're swinging through trees, bouncing off walls, or sprinting up cliffs, movement is your weapon\u2014and your playground.", "short_description": "Meep Runners is a goofy, fast-paced tag game where you run, jump, and fling yourself around with friends. It\u2019s all about chaotic movement, weird maps, and a lot of fun in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/meep-runners2/privacy-policy2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Burgerzrule", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/meep-runners2", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/meep-runners2", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "10091417687650964"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294650_1513132926719782_4874421055509231802_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nBCeBEeGvT8Q7kNvwG-4vs3&_nc_oc=AdoIaSccbwnHPlxny71__jGplv0gK28IDp4j6TOOjzjhEVWmcjrYylFyN0laZglTXYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGI66GjR50bV8_JFQBGjTrD-Nwol9Pl_RMJ7lJ5Mvl3vg&oe=6A8D6F5F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_v